{"data": [{"author_id": "1730565937831538688", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:13:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114797674767512044"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 11, "start": 7, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ogKXktqyPH", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CaktusJxck/status/2114797674767512044/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114797670220873728", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/ogKXktqyPH"}]}, "id": "2114797674767512044", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 591, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC ( $TSM ) is reportedly preparing to raise CoWoS advanced packaging prices by 10–20% as surging AI chip demand tightens capacity, extends delivery times and accelerates expansion plans, according to Taiwan’s Commercial Times.\n\n•Demand:\nAI GPUs, server CPUs and custom ASICs https://t.co/ogKXktqyPH", "url": "https://x.com/CaktusJxck/status/2114797674767512044"}, {"author_id": "795038513100009472", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:04:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114372610310226033"], "id": "2114372610310226033", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI GPU &amp; Memory: When Will the Shortage Turn Into Oversupply?\n\nThe AI boom faces two major supply bottlenecks:\n\n1. GPU Supply\n• TSMC advanced-node capacity\n• CoWoS advanced packaging\n• HBM availability\n• Data center power infrastructure\n\n2. Memory Supply\n• HBM production", "url": "https://x.com/felix_lw/status/2114372610310226033"}, {"author_id": "380820651", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114378957575299158"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Real-time quotes, charts, news & tools from Investing.com. Get AI analysis & premium data with InvestingPro to uncover strategic market opportunities.", "display_url": "Investing.com", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://Investing.com", "images": [{"height": 300, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113311706290266112/QcD8XsLn?format=png&name=orig", "width": 300}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113311706290266112/QcD8XsLn?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "Investing.com - Stock Market Quotes & Financial News", "unwound_url": "https://www.investing.com/", "url": "https://t.co/FAVO7Nri5A"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kk5hcitNbA", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2114378957575299158/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114339024227991552", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/kk5hcitNbA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kk5hcitNbA", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2114378957575299158/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114339035858796544", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/kk5hcitNbA"}]}, "id": "2114378957575299158", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1420, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Samsung's HBM revenue just passed SK hynix for the first time. At least, that's Bernstein's estimate: Q3 Samsung $8.7B vs SK hynix $7.6B.\n\nBe clear on where that comes from. The report itself isn't public; I'm going off https://t.co/FAVO7Nri5A's and VLSI Korea's summaries. https://t.co/kk5hcitNbA", "url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2114378957575299158"}, {"author_id": "2902591129", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:08:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114690733076828329"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 169, "start": 165, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Leoskie_L/stat…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Leoskie_L/status/2114378957575299158", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/jwNPx1yxU4"}]}, "id": "2114690733076828329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114378957575299158", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Samsung passing SK hynix in HBM revenue is a Bernstein estimate built from export data, not a disclosure.\nThe Taiwan stake: SK hynix's HBM4 base die is made on TSMC $TSM logic, while Samsung makes its own. A Samsung share gain is a small loss for TSMC, even if the stacks still https://t.co/jwNPx1yxU4", "url": "https://x.com/BlueyLensTW/status/2114690733076828329"}, {"author_id": "795038513100009472", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:02:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114371956648898659"], "id": "2114371956648898659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC may be the biggest bottleneck in the global AI compute boom.\n\nNVIDIA, AMD, Google TPU, and AWS Trainium all depend heavily on TSMC’s advanced manufacturing.\n\nThe real constraints:\n• Advanced nodes (N3/N2)\n• CoWoS packaging capacity\n• HBM supply\n\nTSMC is investing $60–64B", "url": "https://x.com/felix_lw/status/2114371956648898659"}, {"author_id": "751270202520645632", "created_at": "2026-10-25T11:00:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114311150091251817"], "id": "2114311150091251817", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMCのCoWoS供給能力は2028年末までに月産26万枚へ拡大する計画だが、AIチップの需要増大に追いつかず、依然ボトルネックとなっているようだ。微細化以上に、後工程のパッケージングがAI半導体供給の鍵を握る。特にHBM実装での課題も指摘される。結果、露光装置...", "url": "https://x.com/sugar9634816/status/2114311150091251817"}, {"author_id": "135762800", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:33:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114530947664363793"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8Coxz3CeOh", "end": 196, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yis9617/status/2114530947664363793/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114530924826349568", "start": 173, "url": "https://t.co/8Coxz3CeOh"}]}, "id": "2114530947664363793", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "HBM4 16단 적층에서 두께 775마이크로미터가 사실상 전쟁의 승패를 가릅니다. TSMC CoWoS-L 위에 16단을 올리면 이 한계선에 부딪히는데, 플럭스리스 TC본더로 버틸 라인과 하이브리드 본딩으로 넘어갈 라인이 여기서 갈립니다.\n\n핵심은 장비 서열입니다. SK하이닉스는 16단 초기 물량을 플럭스리스 https://t.co/8Coxz3CeOh", "url": "https://x.com/yis9617/status/2114530947664363793"}, {"author_id": "380820651", "created_at": "2026-10-25T14:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114356304974160281"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/F3p9ADKy1m", "end": 1962, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/firesidealpha/status/2113694871517340029/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113694521792110592", "start": 1939, "url": "https://t.co/F3p9ADKy1m"}, {"display_url": "x.com/firesidealpha/…", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/firesidealpha/status/2113694871517340029", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/fW1I7kYeqD"}]}, "id": "2114356304974160281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1137, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113694871517340029", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\"If you have only a certain amount of memory, you have to decide…\"\n\nAndy Jassy on the a16z podcast, Oct 23. I rewound this part twice.\n\nFirst he lays out AWS capacity: '26 is sold out, '27 is largely sold out (with some held back for on-demand), and a good chunk of '28 is https://t.co/fW1I7kYeqD", "url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2114356304974160281"}, {"author_id": "1480421083799224320", "created_at": "2026-10-25T11:16:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114315085233651947"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/633DgUcXUP", "end": 217, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/na42162na/status/2114315085233651947/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114315078464151552", "start": 194, "url": "https://t.co/633DgUcXUP"}]}, "id": "2114315085233651947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 237, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "반도체 일주일 성적표가 나왔다. SOX -3.2%, 목요일 하루에만 -6.7%였다 📉\n\n1. 장비주가 제일 크게 맞았다: 램리서치 -12.8%, 어플라이드 -7.8%, ASML -4.2%\n2. 칩 설계·로직도 밀렸다: 인텔 -3.2%, AMD -2.3%, 브로드컴 -2.2%, 엔비디아 -1.5%\n3. 그런데 메모리와 파운드리는 버텼다: 마이크론 https://t.co/633DgUcXUP", "url": "https://x.com/na42162na/status/2114315085233651947"}, {"author_id": "1942396529186332676", "created_at": "2026-10-25T11:09:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114313344983195887"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/waslT1w3FZ", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BourseAsieFR/status/2114313344983195887/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114307245018136576", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/waslT1w3FZ"}]}, "id": "2114313344983195887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 3287, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "🚨 Et si le krach de la mémoire attendu en 2028 n’arrivait jamais ?\n\n70–80 % de la surface de silicium d’un rack IA est de la mémoire. La HBM consomme 3 à 4 fois plus de wafers par Go que la DDR5.\n\nCertaines actions mémoire cotent à 2x leurs leurs PE. Bernstein et SA en parle : https://t.co/waslT1w3FZ", "url": "https://x.com/BourseAsieFR/status/2114313344983195887"}, {"author_id": "1874887449404448769", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114674148844708008"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 19, "start": 15, "tag": "ASX"}]}, "id": "2114674148844708008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1411, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今年以来算到10/23收盘， $ASX  涨了140.3%，$AMKR 跌了0.5%。\n\n同样是封装测试龙头，同样站在AI链条上，一家翻了一倍多，一家原地没动。\n\n这一篇讲产业链里的先进封装：$TSM 的CoWoS和SoIC，日月光（$ASX），$AMKR，再顺带设备和材料。\n\n封装这一步做什么。", "url": "https://x.com/youngstockuser/status/2114674148844708008"}, {"author_id": "1759276656143814656", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:44:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114790407460491580"], "id": "2114790407460491580", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Yarı iletken sektöründe \"yapay zeka ticareti\" (AI trade) etrafındaki rallinin yerini belirli aralıklarla sert düzeltmelere ve konsolidasyona bırakması, sektörün temellerinin aniden çökmesinden ziyade **beklenti, değerleme ve sermaye harcaması (CapEx) dinamiklerinin yeniden", "url": "https://x.com/Seyma_Muratt/status/2114790407460491580"}, {"article": {"title": "How Much New AI Compute Comes Online in 2027? Backing It Out from NVIDIA's Revenue"}, "author_id": "1492675031054581760", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:36:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114576801884492234"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2114…", "end": 144, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114572153463214080", "start": 121, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114572153463214080", "url": "https://t.co/6QIq226zyC"}]}, "id": "2114576801884492234", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 362, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "About 15 GW of new NVIDIA compute will be installed and actually powered on in 2027, with a reasonable range of 13–18 GW https://t.co/6QIq226zyC", "url": "https://x.com/y0usali/status/2114576801884492234"}, {"author_id": "815958593832828929", "created_at": "2026-10-25T04:01:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114205660883902590"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lbHeyLIaiu", "end": 192, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BSPK_/status/2114205660883902590/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114205475260739584", "start": 169, "url": "https://t.co/lbHeyLIaiu"}]}, "id": "2114205660883902590", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 2180, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"큰 손들 움직임이 달라졌습니다\" AI 투자 어떻게 대응해야하나. 개인 매수세와 기관 수급 분석｜성상현의 매크로비욘드 6-3부\n\n\"병목에서 해자로\"\n\nAI의 진짜 해자는 진입 장벽에서 나온다. 부족함(병목)은 시간이 지나면 풀리지만 진입 장벽은 남는다. 그래서 AI 인프라는 병목이 아니라 해자로 봐야 https://t.co/lbHeyLIaiu", "url": "https://x.com/BSPK_/status/2114205660883902590"}, {"author_id": "1087168568037240832", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:56:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114113800274104541"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 192, "start": 187, "tag": "TSMC"}]}, "id": "2114113800274104541", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 3534, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "THE AI DIP: THE MARKET REPRICED THE BILL, NOT THE BUILD\n\nOctober took the AI complex apart. Meta grew revenue 26% and got sold. Lam Research printed record revenue and fell 12% in a day. $TSMC guided to 58% growth and the selloff did not even pause. When the strongest demand", "url": "https://x.com/InvestmentGuru_/status/2114113800274104541"}, {"author_id": "978202354146164736", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:51:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114490184184242670"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kDA0a8kwFk", "end": 171, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vagrant_999/status/2114490184184242670/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114490174944243712", "start": 148, "url": "https://t.co/kDA0a8kwFk"}]}, "id": "2114490184184242670", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "💹ワイドモート企業　アドバンテスト(6857)\n\n半導体テスト装置（テスタ）の世界最大手。\n\n1️⃣競争優位性の源泉（4つのワイドモート）\nアドバンテストが半導体業界の「関所」として高い参入障壁と収益性を維持している理由は、主に4つの要素から成り立っている。\n\n❶極めて高いスイッチング・コスト https://t.co/kDA0a8kwFk", "url": "https://x.com/vagrant_999/status/2114490184184242670"}, {"author_id": "1625194866215997440", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:17:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114753230223606229"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 99, "start": 95, "tag": "AMD"}, {"end": 268, "start": 265, "tag": "MU"}, {"end": 274, "start": 269, "tag": "SKHY"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jukan05/status…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jukan05/status/2114499959563370930", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/gDYTxh3ecN"}]}, "id": "2114753230223606229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 346, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114499959563370930", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\"The increase from 8 to 12 HBM stacks per CoWoS package is a positive development for HBM\":\n\n- $AMD MI450 \"is expected to increase the number of HBM stacks within the CoWoS package to 12, delivering 288GB of HBM4\"\n- OpenAI : 12-high HBM4\n- Anthropic : 8-high HBM4\n\n$MU $SKHY https://t.co/gDYTxh3ecN", "url": "https://x.com/AnalysisOp/status/2114753230223606229"}, {"author_id": "1764560724708216832", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:44:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114805310393336085"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}], "hashtags": [{"end": 263, "start": 259, "tag": "WSD"}]}, "id": "2114805310393336085", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 111, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$TSM\nTSMC CoWoS Fiyatını Yine Artırabilir\n\nTSMC’nin CoWoS paketleme fiyatlarında %20’ye varan yeni artışları değerlendirdiği bildiriliyor. AI çip talebi, ileri paketleme kapasitesini fiyatlama gücüne çeviriyor.\n\nMaliyet baskısı zincirin tamamına yayılabilir.\n#WSD", "url": "https://x.com/GetPursa/status/2114805310393336085"}, {"author_id": "1874887449404448769", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:47:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114337932974899492"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 44, "start": 39, "tag": "SOXX"}]}, "id": "2114337932974899492", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 3276, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 13, "retwe